#. y1:english="You don't look familiar.{PA:20}||Take this.\nYou got an \"{CC:ffc8c8}Illegal Arms Dealer's Memo{CR:00}\".\n\nHuh? {PA:10}That gun you got there is||pretty suspect... {PA:10}Where did you get that?\nIt's a defective gun that's been||circulating in the black market.{PA:20}\nIt goes off by accident all the time.\nWhat?{PA:10} You bought that piece of shit??{PA:10}||Oh no. Add another sucker to the count.\nThis gun's been shot before,{PA:10}||most likely the person who shot this{PA:10}\nended up in the hospital or worse.\nWell then. {PA:10}What can I do for you?\nWell then. {PA:10}What can I do for you?\nWhat do you wanna buy?{PA:10}||You can find anything in our shop.\n\nI don't know what you're gonna do with it...||{PA:10}But use it with care.\nWell, {PA:10}come back anytime.\nWhat do you wanna sell?{PA:10}||I only buy weapons and protective gear.\n\nThe number of weapons you can carry is||limited. {PA:10}Keep that in mind for the future.\nHuh? {PA:10}What do you wanna know?\nWell,{PA:10} I have extensive knowledge||on weapons.{PA:20}\nI've seen weapons from all over the world.\nOkay, {PA:10}what do you wanna know?\nAnything else you wanna know?\nWhat is a weapon?\nIs this some kind of philosophical question?{PA:20}||Alright then.\nA \"weapon\", {PA:10}can even be something||you pick up off the ground.\nYou must know about||this already though, {PA:20}right?\nI usually put weapons into 15 categories,{PA:10}||including things you pick up off the ground.\nEven if I told you about all of them,||you wouldn't be able to remember,{PA:10}\nso I'll show you some interesting weapons.\nWhat weapons do you recommend?\nI have to recommend something heavy,{PA:10}||like an advertising display.\nThere's also a rather larger table.{PA:10}||There are numerous heavy weapons.\nWhen you swing something that heavy,{PA:10}||you can knock an enemy back with one stroke.\nOne disadvantage is that it's heavy,{PA:10}||making it hard to swing real fast,\nbut it's very effective when||you're surrounded by enemies.\nThis type of weapons can inflict severe||damage when you throw them.{PA:20}\nKeep that in mind when you come up||against several enemies at once.\nAre there any weapons you can't carry?\nOh, {PA:10}sounds like you know||a thing or two about weapons.\nYou're right.{PA:10}||Heavy weapons can't be carried\nunless you're some sort of||muscle-bound freak.\nOil drums and sofas can be pushed,{PA:10}||but can't be carried.\nWhen you come across these items,{PA:10}\nkick them with full strength||and send them flying.\nWith your strong legs,{PA:10}||I guess they can go a long distance.\nAre there any special weapons?\nSpecial weapons,{PA:10} huh?\nThat just happens to be my specialty.\nOne useful item you might find is||an iron plate.{PA:20}\nYou can shield yourself from bullets||with those.\nThere's also... {PA:10}rope. {PA:20}Someone who knows||how to use it can easily strangle a person.\nOh yeah,{PA:10}||grenade type weapons are pretty handy.{PA:20}\nI'm sure I don't need to tell you||what kind of damage you can inflict.\nNo, {PA:10}thanks.\nYou sure?{PA:10} Come back anytime."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0069.BIN:78_3_59
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/DAY_KAB0069.BIN::line:78_3_59"
msgid "estrangular a una persona fácilmente."
msgstr ""

